                                "sense_id": "7e5a2631-c401-3032-bb1b-e56ad0fbe252",
                                "text": "And I have gathered that Ford talked to Mary Worthington, not in so frank a strain but to the same more generalised effect, about that perpetual bother of sex which so afflicts the unacknowledged underlives of civilised people."
