                                "sense_id": "7e5a2631-c401-3032-bb1b-e56ad0fbe252",
                                "text": "1951, John Cowper Powys, Porius (published 2007),\nIt pushed him on to search into, to try to understand, to seek to share the power of this extraordinary being, the extent of whose underlife was so much larger than his own."
                            }
